Some suggestions for nethack 3.0

1. What about a wand of storm?
   It blows all monsters around you away, but does not directly dammage
   them, except if they are smashed against the wall.
   Very usefull against Nymphs, xans and Gremlins in combination with
   missile weapons or wands.

2. It may be an idea to remove Invisibility out of The Hand of
   Elbereth, because it's not always good. You can't enter shops and
   if you escape the dungeon I think your family does not like it.

3. Why can the Gods solute Hallucination en Punishment?
   Where are the good old hackdays, walking 900 steps hallucinated,
   killing your dog with an heavy iron ball and still escape the
   dungeon with amulet?

4. Can there be more difference between the characters?
   Is it possible to make the weak charaters more attractive?

   Healer:

   The Healer has seen so much different women. So it is very
   strange that his anatomic view cannot resist the seduce attemps
   of a Nymph.
   Also the Healer gets twice as many points.

   Archeologist:

   The Archeologist knows where to sell gems ( which he does not need to
   identify ). So he gets 5 times more points for a gem.

   Barbarian:

   The Barbarian is in all aspects worse then a Valkyrie.
   What about a Burglar?
   The Burglar escaped from jail and now tries to find gold for is
   bail. He starts with an heavy iron ball and -5000 points.
   He is also very strong and does not need identifying weapons.

5. A supertop for the real hackers.
   You gets only a place in the supertop if you escaped the dungeon with
   amulet under all possible characters. 

6. To avoid cheating the program must only take ghostlevels older than
   2 days ( or more ).

